Subject: [PATCH] ghc-pkg: cache a database in name order

The cache followed the order the directory listed the .conf files, which
on tmpfs is the order they were written. Parallel registration left it
different every run, and GHC numbers units, and so orders its CPP version
macros, link info and link lines, by it.
---
--- a/utils/ghc-pkg/Main.hs
+++ b/utils/ghc-pkg/Main.hs
@@ -937,7 +937,7 @@
                               warn ("Timestamp " ++ show tFile
                                 ++ " for " ++ file ++ rel)
             where
-                 confs = map (path </>) $ filter (".conf" `isSuffixOf`) fs
+                 confs = map (path </>) $ sort $ filter (".conf" `isSuffixOf`) fs
 
                  ignore_cache :: (FilePath -> IO ()) -> IO (PackageDB mode)
                  ignore_cache checkTime = do
